{
    "title": "Cast To TV: Screen Mirroring",
    "description": "<b>Cast to TV - Screen Mirroring is an outstanding screencast app for Android phones.</b> It uses wireless display technology to share phone screen on TV. Therefore, you can control TV from afar by using your phone. This app turns your phone into a smart remote control, making life much easier. Let\u2019s explore all the convenience it brings to your life!\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83c\udfc6 Highlight features of Cast to TV - Screen Mirroring:</b>\r\n\u2705 Cast media to TV: photos, videos, documents, etc.\r\n\u2705 Smart screen share with high stability\r\n\u2705 Fast display phone screen on TV\r\n\u2705 Play video games on TV\r\n\u2705 Real-time screen mirroring\r\n\u2705 Control TV with your smartphone\r\n\u2705 Watch videos on big screen\r\n\r\n<b>\u2753 Why choose Cast to TV - Screen Mirroring</b>\r\n<b>\u26a1<i> Transfer media from your phone to TV</i></b>\r\nOur screen sharing app allows you to cast media, display your phone screen on TV with high resolution. You can:\r\n- Cast videos to TV\r\n- Display photos on TV\r\n- View documents on TV\r\n- Cast apps on TV\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udcfa<i> Stream web videos, stream video games</i></b>\r\nBesides casting media, this smart TV cast also helps you stream video games and web videos in real time on TV. You can play video games and watch videos on big screen without disruption and delay. This feature is perfectly useful for family parties like karaoke and online meetings.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83c\udfae<i> Control TV from afar by using your smartphone</i></b>\r\nOur smart screen share app also turns your phone into a smart remote control. Say goodbye to panic moments losing your TV control again with this feature. If you ever misplace one, you always have a spare.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83e\udd47<i> Fast connection without disruption or delay</i></b>\r\nCast to TV has a user-friendly interface and is super easy to use. You can connect your phone to the TV quickly. It allows you to display media and stream videos in real-time with high-quality resolution, thus giving you a good experience sharing screens.\r\n\r\n<b>\u2728<i> Compatible with all smart TV brands</i></b>\r\nYou can cast media, stream videos and share phone screens to all devices.\r\n<b>\ud83d\udca1 How to use Cast to TV - Screen Mirroring</b>\r\n1. Turn off VPN on your smartphone\r\n2. Make sure your TV and smartphone are connected to the same Wi-Fi network\r\n3. Open the app to connect your phone to TV\r\n4. Cast from phone to smart TV\r\n5. Enjoy casting media, watching videos and meeting online on a bigger screen\r\n\r\nAll in all, Cast to TV - Screen Mirroring is a powerful app that will make life more efficient and easier. Whether you want to cast media to TV, display phone screen on TV and remotely control TV, our screen share app will have you covered. Install this wireless display app today and start enjoying your phone display on a bigger screen!\r\n\r\nNote: This smart screen share app may not work well on some smart TVs. If you have any questions, feel free to leave a comment. We will respond as soon as possible.\r\nThanks again for your support. \ud83d\udc96",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Cast to TV - Screen Mirroring is an outstanding screencast app for Android phones.</b> It uses wireless display technology to share phone screen on TV. Therefore, you can control TV from afar by using your phone. This app turns your phone into a smart remote control, making life much easier. Let\u2019s explore all the convenience it brings to your life!<br><br><b>\ud83c\udfc6 Highlight features of Cast to TV - Screen Mirroring:</b><br>\u2705 Cast media to TV: photos, videos, documents, etc.<br>\u2705 Smart screen share with high stability<br>\u2705 Fast display phone screen on TV<br>\u2705 Play video games on TV<br>\u2705 Real-time screen mirroring<br>\u2705 Control TV with your smartphone<br>\u2705 Watch videos on big screen<br><br><b>\u2753 Why choose Cast to TV - Screen Mirroring</b><br><b>\u26a1<i> Transfer media from your phone to TV</i></b><br>Our screen sharing app allows you to cast media, display your phone screen on TV with high resolution. You can:<br>- Cast videos to TV<br>- Display photos on TV<br>- View documents on TV<br>- Cast apps on TV<br><br><b>\ud83d\udcfa<i> Stream web videos, stream video games</i></b><br>Besides casting media, this smart TV cast also helps you stream video games and web videos in real time on TV. You can play video games and watch videos on big screen without disruption and delay. This feature is perfectly useful for family parties like karaoke and online meetings.<br><br><b>\ud83c\udfae<i> Control TV from afar by using your smartphone</i></b><br>Our smart screen share app also turns your phone into a smart remote control. Say goodbye to panic moments losing your TV control again with this feature. If you ever misplace one, you always have a spare.<br><br><b>\ud83e\udd47<i> Fast connection without disruption or delay</i></b><br>Cast to TV has a user-friendly interface and is super easy to use. You can connect your phone to the TV quickly. It allows you to display media and stream videos in real-time with high-quality resolution, thus giving you a good experience sharing screens.<br><br><b>\u2728<i> Compatible with all smart TV brands</i></b><br>You can cast media, stream videos and share phone screens to all devices.<br><b>\ud83d\udca1 How to use Cast to TV - Screen Mirroring</b><br>1. Turn off VPN on your smartphone<br>2. Make sure your TV and smartphone are connected to the same Wi-Fi network<br>3. Open the app to connect your phone to TV<br>4. Cast from phone to smart TV<br>5. Enjoy casting media, watching videos and meeting online on a bigger screen<br><br>All in all, Cast to TV - Screen Mirroring is a powerful app that will make life more efficient and easier. Whether you want to cast media to TV, display phone screen on TV and remotely control TV, our screen share app will have you covered. Install this wireless display app today and start enjoying your phone display on a bigger screen!<br><br>Note: This smart screen share app may not work well on some smart TVs. If you have any questions, feel free to leave a comment. We will respond as soon as possible.<br>Thanks again for your support. \ud83d\udc96",
